---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Fix DroidDeck Steam Login Failed — DroidDeck Guide"
  description="Fix Steam login failures in DroidDeck. QR code, authentication, and connection issues."
  page="troubleshooting"

  locale="en"
>
  <style>
    .page-header{background:var(--night);color:white;padding:90px 0 50px}
    .page-header h1{font-size:36px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .page-header p{color:#93a7ba;max-width:600px}
    .page-content{padding:50px 0 80px;max-width:820px}
    .fix-section{margin-bottom:42px}
    .fix-section h2{font-size:24px;margin-bottom:14px}
    .fix-section p{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9}
    .fix-section ol{padding-left:22px;font-size:15px;color:#43576c;line-height:1.9}
    .fix-section li{margin:10px 0}
    .callout{padding:16px 20px;background:#f0fdf4;border-left:4px solid #16a34a;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;margin:20px 0}
    .callout p{margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#166534;line-height:1.7}
    .tag-list{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px}
    .tag{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:#f0f7fc;color:#147cb9}
  </style>
  
    <section class="page-header">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="hero-label"><span></span> Troubleshooting</div>
        <h1>Steam login failure</h1>
        <p>Cannot log in to Steam inside DroidDeck, or the QR code fails to load.</p>
        <div class="tag-list">
          <span class="tag">Network</span>
          <span class="tag">Authentication</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-content wrap">
      <div class="fix-section">
        <h2>Step-by-step fixes</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>Check your internet connection.</strong> Steam needs a stable connection. Try opening a browser inside DroidDeck or your phone to confirm.</li>
          <li><strong>Restart DroidDeck.</strong> A fresh launch often resolves temporary Steam client issues.</li>
          <li><strong>Use password login instead of QR.</strong> If the QR code doesn't appear or scan, try username + password + Steam Guard code.</li>
          <li><strong>Check date and time.</strong> Incorrect device time can cause Steam authentication to fail.</li>
          <li><strong>Disable VPN or proxy.</strong> Some VPNs interfere with Steam's login servers.</li>
          <li><strong>Clear Steam client cache.</strong> In Steam settings, clear the download cache and restart.</li>
          <li><strong>Check Steam server status.</strong> Visit status.steampowered.com to confirm Steam isn't down.</li>
        </ol>

        <div class="callout">
          <p>Two-factor authentication codes are time-sensitive. If your device's clock is even a minute off, Steam Guard may reject the code.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fix-section">
        <h2>Still stuck?</h2>
        <p>If login still fails, note whether the Steam window loads at all, whether you can reach other websites, and whether you see any error code. Include your DroidDeck version and device model when asking for help.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  
  
</Layout>
